Short:    A config file compiler for CDScroller
Type:     comm/bbs
Uploader: chotch@tig.com.au (Craig Hutchison)
Author:   chotch@tig.com.au (Craig Hutchison)

While attempting to setup CDScroller with TransAmiga, I found that all
the fiddly little bits involved in making up each CD's config files
was probably better spent doing more enjoyable things, and as Urban
Mueller (Aminet) is now releasing 4 Aminet CDs each year, setting up
each new edition can be a tedius task.

With all that in mind, I set about writing an ARexx script to build
the config files for each new Aminet CD automagically. CDS_Setup.rexx
is it.

